Core components of IAM:
IAM has 4 main components :
1.Users
2.Groups.
3.Roles.
4.Policies.
        1.AWS managed policy.
        2.Customer-managed policy.
        3.Inline policy.
        4.Resource-based policy.
        5.Permission boundaries (Guardrail)
        6.Services control policies (AWS Organization)

